NAME
     who - who is logged in

SYNOPSIS
     who
     w
     last

DESCRIPTION
     who prints a line per login: the user, the terminal and when they
     logged in, from /var/run/utmp. Called as w it adds what each of them
     is running; called as last it reads the record of logins past.

SEE ALSO
     uptime(1), login(1), id(1)
